1. Purpose

This file contains the research questions governing:

1. governance of the canonical repository;
2. stewardship, ownership, branch protection, and release authority;
3. compatibility, conformance, forks, licensing, trademarks, and certification;
4. commercial value and maintenance of jurisdiction and industry packs;
5. Runic Consulting discovery, delivery, confidentiality, readiness assessment, monitoring, and third-party licensing.

These questions support the transition from a research repository into a maintainable, licensable, and implementation-ready governance product without allowing commercial interests to override research integrity, legal accuracy, or quality control.

